{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52013","headline":"解六合丞还 · 王绩","name":"解六合丞还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我家沧海白云边，还将别业对林泉，不同功名喧一世，直取烟霞送百年。\n彭泽有田唯种黍，步兵从宦岂论钱？\n但愿朝朝长得醉（李抄本此句作「但使百年相续醉」），何辞夜夜瓮间眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}